Subject: [PATCH] hal: support cross-compiling external components

---
 docs/src/man/man1/halcompile.1.adoc |  34 ++++++++
 src/Makefile.modinc.in              |  69 ++++++++++++---
 src/hal/utils/halcompile.g          | 130 ++++++++++++++++++++++++----
